# --- Event media archived OUTSIDE git (2026-09-12 hygiene) -------------------
# Audio        -> Cloudflare R2:  r2://esep-library/media/<repo path>   (9 files, 222 MB, verified)
# Images + ElevenLabs transcripts -> Google Drive: "My Drive/Empire State Event Media"
# Rationale: git stores every version forever; the OBS capture lane will add
# GB-scale recordings per event. Carousels (.pdf) and notes (.md) stay tracked.
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.wav
Event Content/**/*.jpg
Event Content/**/*.jpeg
Event Content/**/*.png
content-drafts/**/*.jpg
content-drafts/**/*.jpeg
content-drafts/**/*.png
*— Transcript (ElevenLabs).json
el_scribe_v1_plain.json
eleven_scribe_v2.json

